  "description": "Floating islands above an endless sea of clouds, spread across up to three screens. In the middle a sky island with mossy ruins, a giant tree and a waterfall pouring into the clouds; on the left the open cloud sea with drifting rocks; on the right an old airship among towering clouds. With two screens: the island on the left, the airship on the right. With one screen: the island. The islands gently drift up and down, cloud wisps and flocks of birds travel seamlessly from one screen to the next, dandelion seeds, petals or leaves ride the wind. Move the mouse to stir the wind and see the layers shift in depth, click for a gust. Follows your clock from a bright summer day to a glowing sunset and a starry night with fireflies and shooting stars, and the sun rays pulse to your music.",
